{"source_id": "W4388847326", "title": "The effectiveness of note taking through exposure to L2 input: A meta-analysis", "year": 2023, "abstract": "There has been increasing interest in the effects of note taking in second language (L2) research. However, no meta-analysis has been conducted to examine the relationship between note taking and learning through exposure to L2 input. We retrieved 116 effect sizes from 34 studies and found a medium, positive overall effect of note taking (g = 0.56). Moderator analyses showed that the effect was larger for learners with lower proficiency and for immediate rather than delayed posttests, but note-taking medium (longhand vs. digital) did not moderate the effect. However, proficiency was measured at the language level rather than as domain prior knowledge, and medium comparisons were few."}
